{
  "id": "DEU.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 20",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita ng'ucheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas ging'eadi ak guwi ng'ucheewana eemoojiga was weajoodigaagu, ak gidaahi faraasajeega ea mutukwajeega ea lugooda saang'a burdeawa gaagu, adiidu giiwali saawa, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygoosheedeaweey ninyeeda aruunaneey ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gineekiisi ng'ucheeda abeeda gayghoan ashoohoocheanda mwadi ak goobalool buuneeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwayeesha, ‘Oaleaydiit, ea Israeli, askweareani nooneekiisi heeda jea ang'ucheewana sea weajoodigeagwa: adiidu ghabeal gurooruunatkeagwa; nea adiidu ghoabeali, ghana adiidu goohirbabanyi, ghana ghang'udeagwa muuwda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygoodeayeeweey, gang'uchi aba badaydaang'u aba heeda weajoodigaagu, ak gaygagoonyi jooriischooda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygoobalool shirikarajeega hees buuneeda, ak gwayeesha, ‘Gwanda ng'eaha jeeni was siisi nideasi ghooriida eesh ak ea ghamwaash ghawooda? Anung' gabiikta gheanyi, adiidu gameewsa jeeda ng'ucheeda, ak ghamwaash ghawooda siida nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ea ng'eaha siida mida jeeni nihista sabiiboadaanyi ak ea mii gahoosasa haghweagaaschi? Anung' gabiikta gheanyi, adiidu gameewsa jeeda ng'ucheeda, ak gahoosasa siida niirja haghweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ea ng'eaha siida mida jeeni anyeari gatmooda nea ea miighaghi? Anung' gabiikta gheanyi, adiidu gameewsa jeeda ng'ucheeda, ak hean ghaghi gatmoodida sih nuut.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea shirikarajeega hees gaygabiikta goobalool buuneeda, nea gwayeesha, ‘Ng'eaha siida mida jeeni giyooni gurooru nea gwandeawa muuwda? Anung' gabiikta gheanyi, adiidu ghwanung' ghabeal lugooda suurja gida nibealda niny.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda iyahiit shirikarajeega hees gidabaloolda buuneeda, nea abeeda gajeaghwal sugoodiga jea gamiineadaysa buuneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gineekiisi mujiineeda jea ang'ucheewana aba badaydaanyi, asheeda rukwiida ng'asheega hoyyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iyadeelneey ng'asheega hoyyoo ak gwajeaseegwa, abeeda buuneeda sean sinyasa jeedida gaygwasin gadiyeeda sidiing'sa aba badahuukeagwa ak gagadiyeeseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas ea masinneey ng'asheega hoyyoo, hean gang'ucheeweey, abeeda gajaneaweesiina mujiineeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iiyiin NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U geatingaagu abeeda gaybwara headiga sean goosha aba ng'uta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gadeemga ea diibiga, ea dugwa ea haleanjeeda sean mida jeeda mujiini, ea easanga sean, gaygeanda ghoah easangeagwa; ak ang'iing'i gayhoosasiina easanga weajoodigaagu, ghayi goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean abeeda gaysindunu aba mujiinajeega sean sheageeweey, mawoosa mujiinajeegeaba eemoojisu mida hijiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba jeeda mujiinajeegeaba fiisu goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ghoah hearaniischoodean, bwara gameewa sean gilinyoo gwandeawa eaweega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaybwara sean fuga Hiti ea gea Amori, fuga Ganaani ea fuga Berisi, fuga Hifi ea Yebusi, gawuurji gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda ea meanaaleagwa naweadinga nyaawa munyas sina saawa aba badita aseecheeka nyaawa, ak gaysisiina riing'eeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iineaweesi mujiini ea gageawiit, ak goong'uchi aba badaydeaba mujiineedida nea gigasayi gichea geandeayda, adiidu gilajaadi geediga mida jeeda aba joomooda; aba gideaba gajaga haghweagaaschi, nea adiidu gibarsi ng'eanyi. Neada geediga mida jeeda ng'eanyiida ea buuneeda iijea gwayi bwak ea neaweesiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geediga inali gideaba haghweagaaschi maba agita giimuusi laksiina ng'eanyi ak gisini gidingeayoojiga aba uhuuda mujiineeda ng'ucheeweey, bwak ea eajoara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
